{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A linear storyline</strong> in which the protagonist is a special agent infiltrating a restricted area\u2014a former military base. Previously, archaeological excavations were conducted here, and upon uncovering an ancient burial site, scientists released a deadly pathogen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection turns people into mutants, and the survivors have split into warring factions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek salvation,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others attempt to weaponize the virus,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While others kill indiscriminately.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent the spread of the contagion, the zone has been completely isolated\u2014no one can leave. Yet, for unknown reasons, the authorities refuse to destroy the infected territory. Instead, once a month, they send in teams of special agents with classified missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is one such operative, but he has become separated from his squad and must now find them to complete the mission\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841640?t=1774385863","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841640?t=1774385863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841640/56061f1af710c0f6aa601169fd494fd94f62cdfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774385863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841640/56061f1af710c0f6aa601169fd494fd94f62cdfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774385863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A linear storyline</strong> in which the protagonist is a special agent infiltrating a restricted area\u2014a former military base. Previously, archaeological excavations were conducted here, and upon uncovering an ancient burial site, scientists released a deadly pathogen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection turns people into mutants, and the survivors have split into warring factions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek salvation,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others attempt to weaponize the virus,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While others kill indiscriminately.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent the spread of the contagion, the zone has been completely isolated\u2014no one can leave. Yet, for unknown reasons, the authorities refuse to destroy the infected territory. Instead, once a month, they send in teams of special agents with classified missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is one such operative, but he has become separated from his squad and must now find them to complete the mission\u2026</p>","developers":["DiezLife"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841640/66f80d8f05aa20506f4219374a45a24102a33d73/header.jpg?t=1774385863","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3841640/1320196293/1f7a3cf73c352eee81a9b0f5c58d0311e1506a09/1752707244/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752708799","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3841640/1320196293/1f7a3cf73c352eee81a9b0f5c58d0311e1506a09/1752707244/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752708799","high